From 3d37ecc31ec612077facbaa3da9eb23b762a9c46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rebase <rebase@localhost>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:29:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/39] dt-bindings: sunxi: fix up A733 binding details

- declare clocks/clock-names at the top level of the CCU binding so
  additionalProperties: false works as intended
- the A733 PIO has ten interrupt banks, not eleven
- the A733 RTC has a single interrupt and is registered without a
  fallback compatible
- the A733 watchdog takes a single clock input
- register the Orange Pi 4 Pro board compatible and extend the
  Maintainers file pattern to sun60i/sun30i

[rebase onto 7.4-rc3+: the A733 pinctrl binding is now the shared upstream
 allwinner,sun55i-a523-pinctrl.yaml; its fix (main PIO has 10 IRQ banks,
 matching the driver irq_banks = 10) is carried there instead.]
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml        |  5 +
 .../clock/allwinner,sun60i-a733-ccu.yaml      | 99 +++++++++----------
 .../allwinner,sun55i-a523-pinctrl.yaml        | 15 ++-
 .../bindings/rtc/allwinner,sun6i-a31-rtc.yaml | 30 ++++++
 .../thermal/allwinner,sun8i-a83t-ths.yaml     | 22 ++++-
 .../watchdog/allwinner,sun4i-a10-wdt.yaml     | 79 ++++++++-------
 MAINTAINERS                                   |  2 +-
 .../arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi |  1 +
 8 files changed, 161 insertions(+), 92 deletions(-)

